  "bio": "Little TearTattoo is a gifted Belgian tattoo artist who specializes in traditional styles, ensuring that each design is vibrant and timeless. Based in Liège, Belgium, at the charming Quai de la Batte 8, 4000 Liege, they are renowned for their exceptional cleanliness, maintaining an impeccably hygienic studio that promises safety and comfort for every client. Little TearTattoo sets the standard for a sterile tattooing environment, which is just as remarkable as their artistic talent.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Liège, Wallonia, Belgium"
